<title>USA: Beneficial Q4 shr $0.40.</title>
<headline>Beneficial Q4 shr $0.40.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call mean estimate Q4 $0.61</p>
<p>First Call mean estimate annual $5.29</p>
<p>		    (in millions, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			   Three Months	    Twelve Months</p>
<p>			 Ended December 31	Ended December 31</p>
<p>			    1996	 1995	1996	  1995</p>
<p>Net Income (a)	 $23.3	$ 6.9    $ 281.0   $   150.5</p>
<p>Earnings per</p>
<p> Common Share (a)    $ .40	$ .10    $  5.08   $    2.72</p>
